          "content_rating": "Not Rated",
          "description": "Normal People (2020) is a television adaptation of Sally Rooney's bestselling novel, directed in part by Lenny Abrahamson and Hettie Macdonald and adapted for the screen by Sally Rooney with Alice Birch. Starring Daisy Edgar-Jones and Paul Mescal, the series is a restrained romantic drama that tracks an intense, intermittent relationship from adolescence into early adulthood. Set largely in Ireland and at university, the narrative concentrates on how class, self-worth, mental health and communication shape intimacy and identity. Tonally quiet and emotionally observant, the series favors close, naturalistic cinematography and small, revealing performances to explore themes of desire, shame, connection and personal growth.",
